      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, ive been feeling really weird lately. i had the flu a few weeks ago and i thought i was over it, but now i just feel constantly exhausted. like, even walking up my stairs makes me super out of breath and my heart starts racing/palpitating. my chest also feels kinda heavy like there's something sitting on it. is this just part of that post-flu fatigue thing or should i be worried?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
